        <mxCell id="c42" value="&lt;b&gt;One run&lt;/b&gt; (input &lt;code&gt;run_date&lt;/code&gt;): ① start · ② read token · ③ window = watermark + 1 − 1-day lookback → run_date · ④ fetch metadata, daily stats, events (page 1, 2, … until []) with retries · ⑤ land raw · ⑥⑦ PySpark cleans, deduplicates, MERGE (rerun-safe) · DQ checks · ⑧ move the watermark only on success · ⑨ query. A failed run leaves the watermark, so the next run catches up." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#545B64;fillColor=#F8F9FA;strokeColor=#D5DBDB;rounded=1;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="770" width="760" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
